keywords:
  - brain tumour segmentation
  - low-field MRI
  - knowledge distillation
  - conformal prediction
  - health equity
  - domain generalization
abstract: >-
  A deployable, physics-grounded, safe-by-abstention, equitable-by-design brain-tumour
  segmentation system for low-field / LMIC MRI (BraTS-Africa, 64 mT Hyperfine Swoop),
  with teacher-to-student knowledge distillation, a physics-based Bloch low-field
  simulator, group-balanced conformal abstention, fairness-without-harm reporting, and
  INT8 edge deployment.
